WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.920
- You spent time in Berlin

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.000
for your new project?
- Yeah.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.530
- And you had a roommate, right?

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.493
- Yes, I did.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.130
It was a studio apartment

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.890
and it was at this very, very,
very old building in Berlin.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:14.040
A lot of probably terrible
things happened there.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.760
And I was moving in and
I was putting my stuff

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.230
in this dresser.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.420
And all of a sudden I smelled perfume.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.760
And I was like, what is going on?

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.380
Is this like such a fancy place

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.080
that they push perfume through the vents?

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.810
And then I very quickly
realized that I had a roommate

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.800
and I feel like she had
been there since like

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.510
I wanna say the forties.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:40.980
- You mean like a ghost?

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:42.633
- Yeah, I named her Olga.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.083
- And you stayed in it?

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:46.320
- Yes.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.153
- What is happening?

00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:49.050
- We created a relationship.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:51.000
Like she was very sweet.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.290
Her name was not Olga.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.670
I did ask her that

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:56.220
but I couldn't figure out her actual name.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.710
So I asked if it was
okay to call her Olga.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.924
And she was like, "Yeah, whatever."

00:01:00.924 --> 00:01:01.757
- What?

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.110
Like, I'm freaking

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.700
I'm so terrified of stuff like that.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.533
Not terrified.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:07.920
I just don't even wanna know it exists

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.200
if it exists, like, and
you're saying it exists

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.540
which terrifies me.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.160
There's enough going on in this realm.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:14.993
- Oh yes.

00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:15.826
- I don't wanna have to
worry about another one.

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:16.800
That's insane.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.910
And it didn't scare you at all.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.830
Have you been like that,
like since you were a kid?

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:20.663
- Oh yes.

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.380
My mom taught me how to read tarot cards

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.213
when I was a kid.

00:01:23.213 --> 00:01:24.046
She reads palms.

00:01:24.046 --> 00:01:25.140
- I'm obsessed right now with tarot cards.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:26.100
I think they're so fun.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.236
- It's great.

00:01:27.236 --> 00:01:28.620
It's amazing.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.450
- Sometimes really dead on, yeah.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:31.283
- Yeah.

00:01:31.283 --> 00:01:33.540
I mean, if you put like
the right energy into it

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:36.480
and ask the right questions,
you can really be able to,

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.130
it's not a future teller by any mean,

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.320
but you can really be able
to understand the situation,

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.210
where other people come are coming from.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.370
But yeah, no, when I was a kid

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.983
I saw dead people all the time.

00:01:46.983 --> 00:01:48.780
- What in the world?
- Yeah.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.310
I can't see them anymore.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.143
- Okay.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:51.976
See, that's my problem.

00:01:51.976 --> 00:01:54.227
See, I'm a very open person
and that's what scares me

00:01:54.227 --> 00:01:57.630
'cause I literally let
people like, let go whatever.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.220
I'm like, I walk in
somewhere, somebody says

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.050
I'm like, I'm really cool if you're here.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.228
Like, but like, just don't show yourself.

00:02:03.228 --> 00:02:04.061
(Sarah laughs)

00:02:04.061 --> 00:02:05.490
Like we can both be here.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.349
We don't have to know.

00:02:06.349 --> 00:02:07.380
- I don't wanna know what you look like.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.660
- Yeah, I'm like, I don't wanna see you.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.940
'Cause I'm such an open
person, I feel like that they

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.370
it would happen to me
and then I would die.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:15.203
- Oh no.

00:02:15.203 --> 00:02:16.036
- Yeah, I would die.

00:02:16.036 --> 00:02:17.490
- You just have to be
able to protect yourself

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.323
and it's good.

00:02:18.323 --> 00:02:19.620
- I am not that person.

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:20.913
I just like to avoid it.

